               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">NICHT ENTHALTEN:</span>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);"> ATWS-Handeinschaltung bedienen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Abrechnung:</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Summe von Handeinschaltung Stück X Tage = (d)).</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
