               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Zusätzliche Erdungsseil zur profilfreien Erdung</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">einsetzen,</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">(Abrechnung:</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Summe von zusätzl. Erdungsseil</span>
